 R←Test_API_038(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;tempDir;rc;msg;list;newFolder
⍝ Runs "Status" with the third flag, "allUntracked". Git reports a folder that is entirely new as
⍝ a single entry ("?? APLSource/NewStuff/"), and that entry has no extension, so <CompareCommits>'
⍝ filter for APL source files dropped it and every file inside went uncompared. With the flag Git
⍝ lists the files rather than the folder.\\
⍝ Works on a private copy of the fixture because it adds a folder to the project.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 tempDir←FilesAndDirs.GetTempSubDir'APLGit2-',⊃⎕SI
 (##.CiderConfig.HOME,'/TestData/CiderProject4.zip')ZipArchive.UnzipTo tempDir
 newFolder←tempDir,'/APLSource/NewStuff'
 ⎕MKDIR newFolder
 (⊂' r←New' ' r←42')⎕NPUT(newFolder,'/New.aplf')1

 list←0 1 G.Status tempDir
 →T.GoToTidyUp~(⊂'APLSource/NewStuff/')∊list[;3]        ⍝ The folder, and no sign of what is in it

 list←0 1 1 G.Status tempDir
 →T.GoToTidyUp~(⊂'APLSource/NewStuff/New.aplf')∊list[;3]
 →T.GoToTidyUp(⊂'APLSource/NewStuff/')∊list[;3]         ⍝ Now the folder itself is not reported

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce tempDir
 msg Assert rc=0
⍝Done
